  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As the title says, when someone other than myself builds an instance of Invite or Invite+ on the web and presses Invite Me to enter the instance, I usually receive an Invite from myself, but now I do not receive any Invite at all. Of course, I am friends with the instance owner.\nI can Invite Me without any problem for Invite or Invite+ instances where I am the owner, and I can also Invite Me for Friend Only instances where the owner is my friend. The problem occurs when you Invite Me to an Invite or Invite+ instance where your friend is the instance owner.\nPerhaps this problem has occurred since the Secure Instance update a while ago. Previously, Invite Me was possible without any problem even if the friend was the instance owner's Invite or Invite+ instance. This is very inconvenient for certain purposes, for example, when socials are not updated properly, or when you want to share a private world with several people, each at his/her own time.",
